                <pb facs="0331" n="247" sameAs="frus:frus1903/pg247"/>

                <head>[Untitled]</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Navy Department</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Washington, D.
                                C.</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1903-11-03"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">November 3,
                    1903</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Cruiser Atlanta</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Kingston, Jamaica:</hi></p>
                <p>Proceed with all possible dispatch to Colon. Acknowledge immediately. When will
                    you sail?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Darling</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Acting.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
